namespace UObjectToolTips

DreamScrollBar {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar
    src   "A scroll bar whose hierarchy is code, not an asset.\n\nTwo nodes: a track, and a handle inside it. BP_HorizontalScrollbar and BP_VerticalScrollbar are two\nassets because an asset cannot branch on a property; this is one control because code can, and\nDirection is the only thing they disagreed about. The handle's parent IS the track, which is what\nthe behaviour measures the value against -- a scroll bar handle rides the whole track (unlike a\nslider's, which is inset by its own size), because its LENGTH already shrinks the travel.\n\nWHAT THIS CLASS STOPPED DOING\n-----------------------------\nIt used to carry a UUIScrollbar SUBCLASS and re-place the handle itself, because the component\nwrote ratio anchors and exposed neither Handle nor DirectionType to anything but a details panel.\nAll three of those are fixed at the source now: UUIScrollbar places the handle with absolute\ngeometry, takes both writes through public setters, and owns the minimum-length floor together\nwith the drag scale it has to agree with. What is left here is what a control is for -- style,\nproperties a designer and a `<->` binding can reach, and the link to a scroll view.\n\nA bar with no scroll view is a value control in its own right: its value is a position from 0 to 1\nand HandleSize is how much of the track the handle covers. Point it at a UUIScrollView and both\nnumbers become the view's -- progress in, progress out -- which is how the standalone bar drives a\nscroll box.\n\nClicking the track off the handle puts the handle's CENTRE where the track was clicked, clamped to\nthe ends, and a drag from that press carries on from there -- SScrollBar's behaviour. Until this was\nchecked against the 5.8 source a track click paged one handle length toward the pointer (Unity's\nbehaviour), so existing screens now jump where they used to step.\n\nNeither the track nor the arrows are a place the pad's navigation lands or Tab stops, which is how\nSScrollBar behaves: the track's UUIScrollbar starts with bCanNavigateHere off (see its class comment)\nand the arrows are made the same in WireParts. The keys and the stick scroll whatever the bar\nfollows through the focused control instead."
    text  "层级由代码而非资产构成的滚动条。\n\n两个节点：一条轨道，以及轨道内的滑块。BP_HorizontalScrollbar 和 BP_VerticalScrollbar 是两个\n资产，因为资产无法按属性分支；而这是一个控件，因为代码可以分支，且\nDirection 是它们唯一有分歧的地方。滑块的父级就是轨道，行为正是以此为基准衡量数值——\n滚动条的滑块走完整条轨道（不像滑动条的滑块会按自身尺寸内缩），因为其 LENGTH\n已经缩短了行程。\n\n本类不再做的事\n-----------------------------\n它过去带有一个 UUIScrollbar 子类并自行重新放置滑块，因为该组件\n写入比例锚点，且除细节面板外不向任何地方暴露 Handle 或 DirectionType。\n这三项现在都在源头修好了：UUIScrollbar 以绝对几何放置滑块，\n通过公开 setter 接受这两处写入，并连同它必须与之保持一致的拖动缩放一起\n掌管最小长度下限。这里剩下的就是控件该有的东西——样式、\n设计师和 `<->` 绑定能够访问的属性，以及到滚动视图的链接。\n\n没有滚动视图的滚动条本身就是一个数值控件：它的值是 0 到 1 之间的位置，\nHandleSize 是滑块覆盖轨道的比例。把它指向 UUIScrollView，两个\n数字就都变成视图的——进度输入，进度输出——独立滚动条正是这样驱动\n滚动框的。\n\n在滑块之外点击轨道，会把滑块的中心放到点击处，并钳制\n在两端；从该次按下开始的拖动会从那里继续——这是 SScrollBar 的行为。在对照\n5.8 源码核实之前，点击轨道会向指针方向平移一个滑块长度（Unity 的\n行为），所以现有界面的行为从原来的步进变成了现在的跳转。\n\n轨道和箭头都不是手柄导航会落点、Tab 会停住的地方，这正是\nSScrollBar 的行为：轨道的 UUIScrollbar 初始时 bCanNavigateHere 为关（见其类注释），\n箭头在 WireParts 中也被设为相同。按键和摇杆改为通过聚焦的控件\n滚动该滚动条所跟随的内容。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBar:AcceptedMouseButtons {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:AcceptedMouseButtons
    src   "WHICH mouse buttons move this bar -- a bitmask over EDreamUIMouseButtonType, the left button alone\nby default, which is SScrollBar's rule: its OnMouseButtonDown answers EKeys::LeftMouseButton and\nnothing else, so a right drag on the handle or a right click on the track leaves the bar where it\nis and goes on to whatever is behind it. The two arrows answer the same buttons.\n\nUMG has no knob for this; widen it for a bar that should also answer another button. A touch is\nnot a mouse button and always counts. Pushed onto the bar's UUIScrollbar and the two arrow\nbuttons -- UUISelectable::AcceptedMouseButtons is what they consult, the same field UDreamButton\nnarrows. In .dui it is a number, one bit per EDreamUIMouseButtonType value: 1 is Left, 4 is Right,\n5 is both."
    text  "哪些鼠标按键可以移动此滚动条——基于 EDreamUIMouseButtonType 的位掩码，默认只有左键，\n这是 SScrollBar 的规则：它的 OnMouseButtonDown 只响应 EKeys::LeftMouseButton，\n除此之外什么都不响应，因此在滑块上右键拖动或在轨道上右键单击都会让滚动条留在\n原处，并把事件继续传给其后面的对象。两个箭头响应同样的按键。\n\nUMG 没有对应的开关；如果滚动条还应响应其他按键，就把这个范围放宽。触摸\n不是鼠标按键，始终计入。该值会推送到滚动条的 UUIScrollbar 和两个箭头\n按钮上——UUISelectable::AcceptedMouseButtons 正是它们查询的字段，也是 UDreamButton\n收窄的同一字段。在 .dui 中它是一个数字，每个 EDreamUIMouseButtonType 值对应一位：1 是左键，4 是右键，\n5 是两者。"
    state machine
}

