}

DreamScrollBar:bAlwaysShowScrollbar {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:bAlwaysShowScrollbar
    src   "Whether the bar stays put with nothing to scroll -- UMG's bAlwaysShowScrollbar.\n\nTrue, not UMG's false: this bar has always drawn whatever it was placed into, and an existing\nscreen whose bar quietly vanished the moment its list fitted would be a layout that changed\nunder everyone. Only a bar ATTACHED to a scroll view can hide itself -- a bare bar is a value\ncontrol, and it has no \"nothing to scroll\" to be in."
    text  "在无可滚动内容时滚动条是否保持显示——即 UMG 的 bAlwaysShowScrollbar。\n\n为真，而不是 UMG 的假：此滚动条一直都会绘制它所放置的任何内容，而一个\n现有界面如果其滚动条在列表刚好放得下的那一刻悄然消失，那就是所有人脚下\n被改动的布局。只有附加到滚动视图的滚动条才能隐藏自己——独立的滚动条\n是数值控件，它没有可供处于其中的“无可滚动内容”状态。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBar:bAlwaysShowScrollbarTrack {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:bAlwaysShowScrollbarTrack
    src   "Whether the TRACK survives the bar hiding itself -- UMG's bAlwaysShowScrollbarTrack, and the\ngroove a desktop scroll bar leaves behind when its thumb has nothing to say.\n\nOnly consulted while bAlwaysShowScrollbar is off and the attached view fits: then the bar stays\non screen with its HANDLE asleep, rather than the whole bar going and the layout reflowing."
    text  "滚动条隐藏自身时轨道是否保留——即 UMG 的 bAlwaysShowScrollbarTrack，\n也就是桌面滚动条在其滑块无事可说时留下的那道凹槽。\n\n仅在 bAlwaysShowScrollbar 为关且所附加的视图内容放得下时才会参考：此时滚动条\n留在屏幕上而滑块休眠，而不是整条滚动条消失、布局重排。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBar:bShowArrows {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:bShowArrows
    src   "A step button at each end of the track -- the desktop scroll bar's arrows.\n\nOff by default, which is what this bar has always drawn and what a touch-first or console UI\nwants; on, an arrow is pinned to each end, the track is inset between them so the handle never\ntravels underneath one, and a click steps the value by ArrowStepSize."
    text  "轨道两端的步进按钮——即桌面滚动条的箭头。\n\n默认关闭，这也是此滚动条一直以来绘制的方式，符合触控优先或主机 UI\n的需求；开启后，箭头会固定在两端，轨道在二者之间内缩，因此滑块永远不会\n移动到箭头下方，单击会按 ArrowStepSize 步进数值。"
    state machine
}

