DreamScrollBar:HandleSize {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:HandleSize
    src   "How much of the track the handle covers, 0 to 1 -- the visible fraction of whatever is being\nscrolled. A bar attached to a scroll view has this rewritten from the view on every push; a\nquarter is what a bare bar shows so it reads as a bar and not as a filled rail."
    text  "滑块覆盖轨道的比例，0 到 1——即所滚动内容的\n可见比例。附加到滚动视图的滚动条会在每次推送时由视图重写此值；\n独立滚动条会显示为四分之一，使其读起来像滚动条，而不是填满的导轨。"
    state machine
}

