DreamScrollBar:MinHandleLength {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:MinHandleLength
    src   "Floor on the handle's drawn length, in local units. Pushed into the behaviour, which applies it\nto the drawn length and to the drag scale together -- a handle drawn longer than the fraction\nit drags with would run at the wrong rate for the whole of a long list."
    text  "滑块绘制长度的下限，使用局部单位。该值会推送到行为中，行为会同时将其\n应用于绘制长度和拖动比例——如果滑块绘制得比其拖动比例更长，则在长列表中\n整个拖动过程都会以错误速率运行。"
    state machine
}

