DreamScrollBar:SetScrollView {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:SetScrollView
    src   "Drive a scroll view with this bar, both ways.\n\nUUIScrollViewWithScrollbar exists for exactly this and would have been the thing to compose,\nbut its Viewport and its two scrollbar fields are private with no setters, so a control that\nbuilds its own tree cannot hand it its parts. What it does internally is two subscriptions and\na visible-fraction ratio; that is what this is, and it works against a plain UUIScrollView."
    text  "用此滚动条双向驱动滚动视图。\n\nUUIScrollViewWithScrollbar 正是为此而存在，本来也应该是用来组合的对象，\n但它的视口和两个滚动条字段是私有的且没有设置器，因此自行构建控件树的控件\n无法把各部分交给它。它在内部所做的是两个订阅和一个可见比例；这里做的正是这些，\n并且可用于普通的 UUIScrollView。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBar:SetShowArrows {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:SetShowArrows
    src   "Wakes or sleeps the arrows AND re-insets the track, which is why it is a whole style push."
    text  "唤醒或休眠箭头，并重新内缩轨道，因此这是一次完整的样式推送。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBar:SetState {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:SetState
    src   "Position and visible fraction in one call -- UMG's SetState, and the shape a scroll view\nactually pushes: the two numbers always move together, and writing them one at a time lays the\nhandle out twice for one change.\n\n@param bInCollapseIfNecessary Hide the bar when the fraction says everything fits, as\n                              bAlwaysShowScrollbar = false does for an attached view."
    text  "一次调用设置位置和可见比例——即 UMG 的 SetState，也是滚动视图\n实际推送的形式：两个数值总是一起变化；若一次只写入一个，就会为一次变更而\n布局滑块两次。\n\n@param bInCollapseIfNecessary 当比例表明所有内容都放得下时隐藏滚动条，正如\n                              附加视图在 bAlwaysShowScrollbar = false 时所做的那样。"
    state machine
}

DreamScrollBar:SetStyle {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:SetStyle
    src   "Replace the whole look and re-push it -- thickness and margin are geometry, not paint."
