DreamScrollBar:Style {
    at    Source/DreamGUIControls/Public/Controls/DreamScrollBar.h#DreamScrollBar:Style
    src   "This instance's own look. The project sheet wins while StyleSource says so AND a sheet actually\nexists; with no sheet in the project this IS the look in effect. A scroll box overwrites it\nwholesale with its own style's Bar, so one style edit dresses the box and its bar together."
    text  "此实例自身的外观。当 StyleSource 指定时，只要项目中确实存在样式表，就以项目样式表为准；\n项目中无样式表时，此属性即为生效的外观。滚动框会用其自身样式的 Bar 整体覆盖它，\n因此一次样式编辑即可同时装扮滚动框及其滚动条。"
    state machine
}

